{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logos/e49051c61b17693a7d5cec8c9a96fe56.jpeg",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&bull; 品牌介紹：</span></span><a href=\"The gems collection (formerly known as ABC Collection) was created by Mr. Zhao and his wife in 2015. Its inspiration comes from the cultivation civilization in the Chinese tradition. When we touch our hundreds of thousands with our hearts, we can feel it for decades  When listening to its story, how can one not hold a heart of awe, awe of the good fortune of God, and the wisdom of heaven and earth.  We hope that our products will bring good luck and protective energy to you and your family.  There is nothing more exciting than touching the mysterious power that belongs to you with your own hands!\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">寶石系列（原名ABC Collection）由趙先生夫婦於2015年創作，其靈感來源於中國傳統的修養文明。</span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">當我們用心去觸動我們的千千萬萬，感受它幾十年的時間，聆聽它的故事，怎能不懷著一顆敬畏之心，敬畏上蒼的造化，敬畏天地的智慧。</span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">我們希望我們的產品能為您和您的家人帶來好運和保護能量。</span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">沒有什麼比親手觸摸屬於你的神秘力量更令人興奮的了！</span></span></a></span></span><br><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&bull; 產品描述：</span></span><a href=\"After years of collecting and researching, Gems Collection has gained a profound understanding of the unique qualities of each gemstone. We want to share this beauty with more people, so we began transforming these stones and gemstones into exquisite jewelry to convey the various emotions and meanings that each gemstone represents.    Every product at Gems Collection is carefully crafted by our artisans, who pay close attention to every detail and strive for the highest quality standards to ensure that each piece is impeccable. This passion and dedication have made Gems Collection a brand that pursues excellence and is worthy of your trust, whether it be as a gift or for your own jewelry collection.\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">經過多年的收集和研究，Gems Collection 對每顆寶石的獨特品質有了深刻的了解。</span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">我們想與更多人分享這份美好，所以我們開始將這些石頭和寶石轉化為精美的首飾，以傳達每顆寶石所代表的各種情感和意義。</span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Gems Collection 的每一件產品都由我們的工匠精心打造，他們密切關注每一個細節，力求達到最高質量標準，以確保每件作品都無可挑剔。</span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">這種熱情和執著使 Gems Collection 成為一個追求卓越的品牌，無論是作為禮物還是您自己的珠寶收藏，都值得您信賴。</span></span></a></span></span><br><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&bull; USP（獨家銷售點）：物美價廉，天然材料，手工製作，神秘能量和社會指導是產品所獨有的。</span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&bull; 付款條件：</span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&bull; 其他信息：</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>",
